and opens it up and exposes

00:40:05.270 --> 00:40:07.910
all that data and some of
those insights out of the box,

00:40:07.910 --> 00:40:10.345
come find Dave and
I after the talk.

00:40:10.345 --> 00:40:11.720
If we get kicked
